msgid ""
"When someone asks for a copy of their data, or to have it deleted, by mail "
"or post, find their account here. The file holds everything the site keeps "
"about the account and the children it's a guardian of, as the family gets it "
"with Download my data on their account page. Send it only to the account's "
"own email address."
